  m_Name: Tutorial_Health
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SO_CutSceneEventContent
  type: 1
  _speakerName: Master
  _dialougeTexts:
  - Nice control of your ball Paddle. Moving on this gauge is your health
  - Taking direct hit from the incoming brick or enemy projectile can harm you
  - In addition, I also link you life energy and the tower into one
  - So if the tower takes damage, you too will take damage aswell
  - Reason was because the last apprentice task with fixing the tower bailed on me
  - So as punishment, I used his lifeforce to rebuild the tower
  - So guard the tower with your left
  - No Pressure tho
